      "Creates standalone Angular component structures using OnPush change detection.",
      "Applies signal inputs, outputs, models, computed values, and transforms.",
      "Defines host classes, attributes, styles, and event bindings through component metadata.",
      "Implements content projection, view queries, content queries, and dependency injection.",
      "Uses native control flow, deferred loading, and optimized image guidance.",
      "Provides keyboard and ARIA patterns for accessible interactive components."
